    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but you dont get it. it's not just a \"phase\" or \"distorted beliefs.\" it's common sense. if i stay, i keep hurting them. if i go, the hurt stops. it's like... if you love something and it's hurting everything around it, wouldn't the most merciful thing to do be to just end the cycle? wouldn't that be the right thing to do?",
